  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\n\"Beneath The Skin\" stands as a sanctum of creativity nestled in Skegness, United Kingdom, specializing in the evocative shades of black and gray tattoos. This appointment-only studio, prides itself on bespoke designs and detailed artistry, offered by the talented resident artists, including the renowned @ryanmarchtattoo and @tattoosbyrianna. They're not just about adorning your body but also offer expert laser removal services with @kjclinic, making them a one-stop sanctuary for both etching and erasing art beneath your skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Skegness, England, United Kingdom"
